# spangap-inside (it must work from inside the container too, reached via
# `spangap docker claude`), so we let it fall through to the in-container
# dispatch below — `ensure_container` then `docker exec ... spangap reset`,
# which touches the same workspace-root .spangap-resetme marker. (Tearing the
# workspace's container/image down is still the host-only `spangap
# reset-workspace`.)
push-all)
